            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko umwe mu banditsi yumvise bajya impaka amenya yuko abashubije neza, aramwegera aramubaza ati “Mbese itegeko ry'imbere muri yose ni irihe?”",
          "type": "text",
