              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahamagara abigishwa be arababwira ati “Ndababwira ukuri, yuko uriya mupfakazi atuye byinshi kuruta ibyo abandi bose batuye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
